# 📊 Seaborn: Basic to Advanced

A comprehensive **Seaborn** tutorial repository covering everything from **basic to advanced data visualization** using Python. Learn how to create beautiful statistical graphics, perform Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA), and build professional visualizations for Data Science and Machine Learning projects.

---

## 🚀 Features

* 📚 Beginner to Advanced Seaborn Tutorials
* 📊 Real-World Data Visualization Examples
* 📈 Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA)
* 🎨 Plot Styling & Customization
* 📉 Statistical Charts
* 💻 Jupyter Notebook Examples
* ✅ Clean, Well-Commented Code

---

## 📚 Topics Covered

* Introduction to Seaborn
* Loading Datasets
* Distribution Plots (Histplot, KDE, Displot)
* Relational Plots (Scatter, Line)
* Categorical Plots (Bar, Count, Box, Violin, Strip, Swarm)
* Matrix Plots (Heatmap, Correlation, Clustermap)
* Pairplot & Jointplot
* Regression Plots
* Styling & Themes
* FacetGrid, PairGrid & JointGrid
* Advanced Visualization Techniques

---

## 🛠️ Technologies Used

* Python
* Pandas
* NumPy
* Matplotlib
* Seaborn
* Jupyter Notebook

