## ⚙️ Installation

```bash
git clone https://github.com/Shubhamnexus-prog/100-days-of-ml.git

cd 100-days-of-ml

pip install seaborn matplotlib pandas numpy

jupyter notebook
```

---

## 📌 Sample Code

```python
import seaborn as sns
import matplotlib.pyplot as plt

tips = sns.load_dataset("tips")

sns.scatterplot(
    data=tips,
    x="total_bill",
    y="tip",
    hue="sex"
)

plt.title("Restaurant Tips Analysis")
plt.show()
```

